            "text": "theorem sigma_eq_negative_primitive (P : Patch) (e : ℕ) {F : ℝ × E → ℝ}\n    (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F) (hs : RadialAlias.RadiallySupported P.a P.b F) (z : ℝ × E) :\n    sigma P e F z = -(∫ r in (0 : ℝ)..z.1, r ^ e * adjusted P e F (r, z.2)) / z.1 ^ e"
